子圉","kind":"person","person_id":"a9v_t0d_3va_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m028-0423","start":423,"end":425,"surface":"宗女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、短稱或官稱指代待核；不補造姓名或自動合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p042","text":"邳鄭使秦，聞裏克誅，乃説秦繆公曰：「呂省、郤稱、冀芮實爲不從。若重賂與謀，出晉君，入重耳，事必就。」秦繆公許之，使人與歸報晉，厚賂三子。三子曰：「幣厚言甘，此必邳鄭賣我於秦。」遂殺邳鄭及裏克、邳鄭之黨七輿大夫。邳鄭子豹奔秦，言伐晉，繆公弗聽。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"邳鄭","kind":"person","person_id":"rlv_clg_euu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"uon_qea_38x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"秦繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"呂省","kind":"person","person_id":"iwp_3ea_wpr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"郤稱","kind":"person","person_id":"syy_h2t_4ie","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"冀芮","kind":"person","person_id":"5sp_ts1_az0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"晉君","kind":"person","person_id":"a9v_t0d_3va","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"秦繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"三子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m042-0068","sta